      "id": "facts-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 734,
      "width": 892,
      "height": 82,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Key Facts\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2022 Write-through: provisioning writes to vault before reporting success; no write cache\n\u2022 Read-through: auth and graphql cache credentials + pools with TTL; vault only called on cold cache or TTL expiry\n\u2022 Auth fetches ES256 signing key once at startup; GraphQL fetches JWKS with 30m TTL auto-refresh\n\u2022 Rotation: admin triggers \u2192 vault PUT overwrites \u2192 caches expire naturally within TTL (or manual invalidate)\n\u2022 Sealed vault: all reads fail with 503; auth/graphql retry on next request after unseal",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "facts",
      "originalText": "Key Facts\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2022 Write-through: provisioning writes to vault before reporting success; no write cache\n\u2022 Read-through: auth and graphql cache credentials + pools with TTL; vault only called on cold cache or TTL expiry\n\u2022 Auth fetches ES256 signing key once at startup; GraphQL fetches JWKS with 30m TTL auto-refresh\n\u2022 Rotation: admin triggers \u2192 vault PUT overwrites \u2192 caches expire naturally within TTL (or manual invalidate)\n\u2022 Sealed vault: all reads fail with 503; auth/graphql retry on next request after unseal",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
